      "start": 66,
      "end": 68.04
    },
    {
      "text": "About taking the entire social",
      "start": 68.04,
      "end": 69.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Experience of college and putting it",
      "start": 69.68,
      "end": 72.08
    },
    {
      "text": "The site got 2,200 hits within 2 hours.",
      "start": 72.08,
      "end": 76.3
    },
    {
