    },
    {
      "text": "Be left behind?",
      "start": 91.48,
      "end": 94.66
    },
    {
      "text": "Let's sue him in federal court.",
      "start": 92.32,
      "end": 95.89999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Wait to stand over your shoulder and",
      "start": 94.36,
      "end": 95.6
    },
    {
      "text": "Watch you write as a jackass.",
      "start": 95.6,
      "end": 97.89999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "If you guys were the inventors of",
      "start": 96.48,
      "end": 97.6
    },
    {
      "text": "Facebook, you'd have invented Facebook.",
      "start": 97.6,
      "end": 101.74
    },
    {
      "text": "Is there anything that you need to tell",
      "start": 99.64,
      "end": 102.06
    },
    {
      "text": "Your actions could have permanently",
      "start": 101.76,
      "end": 102.84
    },
    {
      "text": "Destroyed everything I've been working",
      "start": 102.84,
      "end": 104.16
    },
    {
      "text": "We have been working on.",
      "start": 104.16,
      "end": 106.53999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Did you like being a joke? Do you want",
      "start": 105.08,
      "end": 107.25999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "To go back to that?",
      "start": 106.24,
      "end": 109.89999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "This is our time.",
      "start": 109.92,
      "end": 115.3
    },
    {
      "text": "You're being accused of intentionally breaching security, violating",
      "start": 113.24,
      "end": 119.25999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Copyrights, violating individual",
      "start": 116.88,
      "end": 120.64
    },
    {
